   "body": "**mac/mac-mbp**: runtime pass of #1388 (https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/issues/1388#issuecomment-7223560232): **partly confirmed**: the double load is real (tail load `gen=2`, then `task(id: wantedFilter=favorites)` `gen=3`), but only 2 GETs leave: `gen=2` is superseded while awaiting `isLoggedIn`, before its request. The third, cancelled GET is timing-dependent. Lower severity.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
